    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<b>1. EXAMINE TABLE EVIDENCE</b>\nClick on physical items lying on the
    investigation desk to inspect details, rotate 360\xB0, and uncover hidden hotspots.\n\n<b>2.
    READ THE CASE DOSSIER</b>\nOpen the detective notebook to review victim information,
    suspect backgrounds, known alibis, and discovered clue logs.\n\n<b>3. INTERROGATE
    & EXPOSE CONTRADICTIONS</b>\nQuestion suspects. When a statement contradicts
    physical evidence, press <b>[CHALLENGE]</b> and present the matching proof to
    trigger a breakthrough confession!\n\n<b>4. SYNTHESIZE DEDUCTIONS</b>\nConnect
    pairs of clues on the Deduction Board to formulate decisive deductions.\n\n<b>5.
    CONCLUDE THE CASE</b>\nAnswer the multiple-choice conclusion inquiry to grade
    your detective performance (Rank S to D, 1 to 5 Stars)!"
